{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5828e051-2f5f-8f51-ad90-37c94e57a218",
  "created_at": "2026-02-25T11:44:14-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Margaret Gardiner",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:41:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:41:18-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, hello, sure. Hi Denise. I'm calling about a storm drain, it's right in front of my house, and, um, can you hear me okay? I'm outside, kind of."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:41:30-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're a little choppy but I've got you. Go ahead. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:41:36-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, it's 226 Bliss Road, on the Easton's Beach side. [line breaks up] ...since the nor'easter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:41:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you cut out right there. Since the nor'easter, what happened?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:41:48-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, of course. So that storm last weekend, Saturday into Sunday, the drain out front just wouldn't take any water. It backed up the whole street and a few inches came right into my cellar. And I've lived here years, years, and that has never happened. Never."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:42:06-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few inches in the cellar, okay. Is the water still there or has it gone down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:42:13-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, it's mostly out now, yes, absolutely. But this morning I went out and cleared the leaves off the grate by hand. Packed in there solid. And it worked, sure, for about ten minutes, and then it was backing up again. [pause] So it's not just leaves."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:42:31-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, so something's probably blocked down the line. That's not something you can fix with your hands, you did what you could."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:42:40-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, no, I know. But honestly, I shouldn't have to be out there with the leaves in the first place. This drain, nobody has ever come look at it. I'm wrapping my scarf on right now, it's freezing, I'm heading back out to look at it again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:42:59-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, stay out of the street if there's traffic. Let me get this entered. 226 Bliss Road, storm drain not draining, water in the cellar after the storm, grate cleared by hand. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:43:13-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, absolutely, that's right. Sure. So will you open a work order? And what date, do you know what date somebody would come?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:43:22-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'm opening a work order now. As for a date, I can't give you one from here. The crews are working through a big list after that storm, and the drains that are blocked go to the top. The supervisor sets the schedule."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:43:39-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, sure, I understand. But, can somebody call me and say when? Because I'd like to know whether to, you know, [inaudible] get the cellar cleaned out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:43:50-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Is the best number the one you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:43:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's 401-555-0171."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:43:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0171. Got it. I'll note that you want a call back with a date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:44:03-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. Thank you, Denise. I'm going out now, so if I drop out, that's why."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-25T11:44:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Bundle up. Somebody will be in touch."
    }
  ],
